{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The  sum  of  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />  consecutive  integers  is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />.  Find  the  second  largest  integer.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/0/9c0ab4875678d37f606d04b9d6d8d75d2f23bcae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,17\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,72\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,95\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,101\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,102\\quad\\mathrm{(F)}\\,111\\quad\\mathrm{(G)}\\,125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"474\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the first number in the series, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/1/911d16917549b141d8971ec45e01be6e35184002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + (a + 1) + \\cdots (a + 15) + (a+16) = 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"343\" height=\"18\" />.  By combining like terms, we can solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373ee73df35f95450db87b785a1d98f160a941e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 17a + (17 \\cdot 8) &amp;= 2006 \\\\ a + 8 &amp;= 118 \\\\ a &amp;= 110 \\end{align*}\" width=\"162\" height=\"64\" />\nSince the first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79dc7d13216568e73c831d7b8c14c1a30f7831a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, the second to last term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae9ebdcce53960a6d1ce760bd8e6b0eaeed070d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110+15 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(G) } 125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"167\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alternatively let the sum be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647f025130f04e79c3c01860b25e40e3aac8e39d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-8)+(a-7) + (a-6) + ... + a + (a+1) + (a+2) + ... + (a+8)\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Then, the sum nicely simplifies to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db73e4d0300028f480b50e1b5d859c5001a50468.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[17a = 2006\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d02905195946296ec7a3fb952081b27c252de821.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=118\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />.\nThen, the second to last term is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f4c9a87ae54f8d0bcc076adea5064d7b3b5cc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$118+7 = \\boxed{125}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a h